= The eastern flank asks for a commitment

Allies want a clear Polish position. A procurement pledge is visible; shelters,
rail, hospitals, energy reserves and refugee capacity are less visible and no
less strategic.

**Ukraine solidarity:** [+ ukraine_solidarity +] · **military trust:** [+
military_trust +] · **US reliability:** [+ us_alliance_reliability +].

- @deterrence
- @resilience
- @restraint

@deterrence
title: Back integrated air defence and sustained Ukrainian self-defence
subtitle: Military trust +5, Ukraine solidarity +4 and fiscal stress +3.
on-arrival: military_trust += 5; ukraine_solidarity += 4; eu_eastern_coalition += 5; us_defence_channel += 3; fiscal_stress += 3; left_atlanticist_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The Left makes eastern deterrence part of its European programme"

The commitment reassures allies and creates a budget argument at home. The
Left insists on open procurement and domestic industrial work rather than a
blank cheque.

- #poland_card_finish

@resilience
title: Put shelters, hospitals, rail and refugee services inside defence
subtitle: Public trust +4, local network +3 and household security +2.
on-arrival: public_trust += 4; local_network += 3; household_security += 2; health_capacity += 2; refugee_service_capacity += 2; military_trust += 2; eu_eastern_coalition += 3; news_headline = "Civil resilience becomes part of the national-security budget"

Mayors and service workers finally enter a file usually reserved for generals
and procurement officials.

- #poland_card_finish

@restraint
title: Refuse another open-ended military commitment
subtitle: Escalation risk −5; military trust −4 and Ukraine solidarity −3.
on-arrival: war_escalation_risk -= 5; progressive_credibility += 2; military_trust -= 4; ukraine_solidarity -= 3; eu_eastern_coalition -= 4; left_atlanticist_dissent += 5; konf_poll_momentum += 0.2; news_headline = "The Left draws a limit that eastern allies read as retreat"

The position contains a serious warning about escalation and no convincing
answer to what happens if Russian pressure succeeds.

- #poland_card_finish
